<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VideoServer EPS view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VideoServer EPS view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer said it raised its 1997 earnings estimate on VideoServer Inc to $0.92 a share from $0.89.</p>
<p>-- said it reiterated its outperform rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- VideoServer gained 2-3/8 to 45-1/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
